An ancient<ref name="MIS AD" /> '''hill town''' was active during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="MIS" /> Between [[18 BBY]] and [[15 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-interview-stellan-skarsgard-elizabeth-dulau|text=<i>Andor</i>'s Stellan Skarsgård and Elizabeth Dulau Break Down Luthen and Kleya}} states that [[Kleya Marki]] and [[Luthen Rael]] had known each other for 17 [[Standard year|years]] by the events of "[[Who Else Knows?]]" The episode occurs directly after "[[Make It Stop]]," which dates itself to [[1 BBY]]. Therefore, Marki and Rael's first meeting and Rael's subsequent defection occurred around the year [[18 BBY]]. "Make It Stop" establishes that the execution of the five civilians on a [[Unidentified planet (hill town)|planet]] takes place before the creation of the [[Axis network]], which "[[Coruscant: Whispers of Rebellion]]" states was founded a [[Standard decade|decade]] before the events of [[Star Wars: Andor|''Andor'']] [[Andor Season 1|Season 1]], which takes place in [[5 BBY]] per the reasoning [[:Template:AndorDate|here]]. Therefore, the bombing must have occurred between 18 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|BBY]] and [[15 BBY]].</ref> the [[human]]s [[Luthen Rael]] and [[Kleya Marki]] were present in the [[City|town]] to bargain a [[Devaronian victory necklace]] with the vendor [[Grenwig]].<ref name="MIS" />

